                         "STAGE2: built from burrito-stage1-builds C6. This is the tightest recipe in the batch. It clears the 400 cap ONLY on the recorded trims: skinless thigh (respec from skin-on), rice trimmed to a dry weight that cooks up to about a third of a cup per burrito, cheese held to a light dusting of reduced fat mozzarella, sour cream swapped to Greek yogurt, and the FRIED PLANTAINS DROPPED. Do not restore plantains and do not add oil.",
                         "Skin-on jerk thigh runs materially higher in fat; the macro basis here is skinless thigh, so the prose says skinless. If skin goes back on, the published number is wrong.",
